The new landing page follows the same sequence as the product: compare campaigns, check the evidence and save a report to return to. The visual system connects campaign signals to a decision, while the interactive example lets visitors explore performance, evidence and saved reports before creating a workspace.

The paired-frame mark, Geist typography and violet palette connect this introduction to the working interface. The copy speaks to a familiar task: preparing for the client call or giving the team a clear next step.
